    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4df69d732b3049588880a9ea4bfaf548",
      "statement": "The server applies a 60 requests/minute ulule/limiter v3 fasthttp middleware keyed by the socket peer address by default, or by the outermost X-Forwarded-For IP only when APP_TRUST_PROXY is set (which must only be enabled behind a proxy that strips/replaces that header).",
